  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **instr**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Albino Skunk**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Long Gone, Red Rocking Chair [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2015-02-27.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 6 songs; 24 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The 16-bit version was resampled to 44.1kHz and processed with Waves L3 limiting and dithering [1]\n- **billystrings2015-02-27.flac24**: source not stated; 6 songs; 24 min [2]. Said about its sound: The 24-bit file was processed with Waves L3 Ultramaximizer for limiting, dither, and noise shaping [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2015-02-27.flac16**: taped by gilde; transferred by gilde; source: Schoeps MK-4 > Sound Devices 702 [1]. Also: Recorded 3-5 feet from performers using a custom pre-amp and Sound Devices 702 at 24-bit [1]\n- **billystrings2015-02-27.flac24**: taped by gilde; transferred by gilde; source: Schoeps MK-4 > Sound Devices 702 [2]. Also: Captured 3-5 feet from performers via custom pre-amp feeding a Sound Devices 702 at 24-bit, 96kHz [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Hyatt Regency Bellevue - Bellevue, WA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-hyatt-regency-bellevue-bellevue-wa/) [5]",
